nade]]\n* 1 tbsp [[Cookbook:Mince|minced]] [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]]\n* 2 tbsp unsalted [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]]\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* ½ tsp freshly-ground [[Cookbook:Pepper|black pepper]]\n* ¼ cup [[Cookbook:Ricotta|ricotta cheese]]\n* 30 cherry [[Cookbook:Tomato|tomatoes]], with the very top removed\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Combine all ingredients except tomatoes to make the filling.\n#Place filling into a gallon-size zip-top bag with a small hole snipped in one of the bottom corners.\n#Fill tomatoes about ¾ full.\n#Serve chilled as an appetizer.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using basil]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cream cheese]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garlic]]\n[[Category:Recipes using tomato]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ricotta]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pepper]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Cheese Stuffed Tomatoes","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"¼ cup cream cheese","sourceText":"¼ cup cream cheese","amountText":"¼ cup cream cheese","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 tbsp basil chiffonade","sourceText":"1 tbsp basil chiffonade","amountText":"1 tbsp basil chiffonade","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 tbsp minced garlic","sourceText":"1 tbsp minced garlic","amountText":"1 tbsp minced garlic","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"2 tbsp unsalted butter","sourceText":"2 tbsp unsalted butter","amountText":"2 tbsp unsalted butter","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"½ tsp salt","sourceText":"½ tsp salt","amountText":"½ tsp salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"½ tsp freshly-ground black pepper","sourceText":"½ tsp freshly-ground black pepper","amountText":"½ tsp freshly-ground black pepper","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBind